      "path": "/books/al-kafi:5:3:62:1",
      "text": [
        " لَا يُدْخَلُ بِالْجَارِيَةِ حَتَّى يَأْتِيَ لَهَا تِسْعُ سِنِينَ أَوْ عَشْرُ سِنِينَ ."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.hubeali": [
          "A number of our companions, from Sahl Bin Ziyad, from Ahmad Bin Muhammad Bin Abu Nasr, from Abdul Kareem Bin Amro, from Abu Baseer, ",
          "(It has been narrated) from Abu Ja’far<sup>asws</sup> having said: ‘One cannot copulate with the girl until there come to her nine years or ten years’."
        ],
        "en.sarwar": [
          "1. A number of our people have narrated from Sahl ibn Ziyad from Ahmad ibn Muhammad from ibn abu Nasr from ‘Abd al-Karim ibn ‘Amr from abu Basir who has said the following: (...Consult Fatwah about this Hadith) "
        ]
      }
